erchanged"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A ","type":"text"},{"code":"Begin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"\/","type":"text"},{"code":"End","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" pair is not rewritten into a range, nor a range into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pair, on grounds of totality: open spans may overlap or go","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unterminated, and a range is a tree that can express neither.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"A real score may contain","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"\\slurBegin:1 \\beam( b\/16 \\crescBegin c3 d e&) \\slurEnd:1 \\crescEnd"},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which interleaves three spans across the beam’s range. Restricting the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"rewrite to the safe subset would be worse than not doing it: identical"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"fragments would format differently depending on distant context."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"An-end-carries-no-parameters","text":"An `end` carries no parameters","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Every ","type":"text"},{"code":"…End","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" name takes no parameters at all. A payload whose span is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNTag\/Span-swift.enum\/end"},{"type":"text","text":" therefore refuses typed parameters, and none is ever emitted."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Parameters written on an "},{"code":"…End","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tag keep it reserved"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"through the parser, and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/IvorGMN\/documentation\/IvorGMN\/GMNNormalizer","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" drops them —","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"tex